# <dnp3-client> in bennu mode against the stock outstation (ww-7mw.1). The DUT is the master (stock/client-dnp3.xml: bennu's sample
# dnp3-client.xml plus an sbo binary output, a direct analog output and an input the outstation lacks); the stock outstation
# (stock/server-dnp3.xml, the sample plus the same two outputs) runs beside it under stock/servectl.py, so peer.sh can stop and start it.
# peer.sh drives the master's command interface (stock/probe_cmdif.py) and check.sh wants the replies, and what the master sent, equal
# to the stock master's (stock/client-dnp3.golden). Record that golden: conformance/stock/run-stock.sh dnp3-client
CFG=${CFG:-${here:-/conformance}/stock/client-dnp3.xml}
STOCK_CMD='cd /tmp && bennu-field-device --f /tmp/cfg.xml'
DUT_EXTRA="conformance/stock/servectl.py:/tmp/servectl.py conformance/stock/server-dnp3.xml:/tmp/server.xml"
DUT_PRE='python3 /tmp/servectl.py 5999 bennu-field-device --f /tmp/server.xml'
WARMUP=3
CAPTURE_FILTER='tcp port 20000'
PROTO_FILTER='dnp3'
# the master's connect attempts while the outstation is down are refused
EXPERT_ALLOW='IIN Abnormality|Connection reset|Connection finish'
ZEEK_LOAD=''
